#NEXUS

[ fiorillo2014a_fig6: Tyrannosaurid time tree, root at the bottom. Tyrannosauridae (node circle at the root) and Tyrannosaurinae (stem symbol on the branch below the tyrannosaurine node) kept as internal labels. 11 tips, fully resolved; 2 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Random-sample case (seed 20261114). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=11;
    TAXLABELS
        Albertosaurus
        Gorgosaurus
        Daspletosaurus
        Two_Medicine_taxon
        Teratophoneus
        Bistahieversor
        Lythronax
        Nanuqsaurus
        Zhuchengtyrannus
        Tarbosaurus
        Tyrannosaurus
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE fiorillo2014a_fig6 = [&R] ((Albertosaurus,Gorgosaurus),((Daspletosaurus,Two_Medicine_taxon),(Teratophoneus,(Bistahieversor,(Lythronax,(Nanuqsaurus,((Zhuchengtyrannus,Tarbosaurus),Tyrannosaurus))))))Tyrannosaurinae)Tyrannosauridae;
END;
